Package: budgie-showtime-widget
Architecture: any
Replaces: budgie-showtime-applet,
Breaks: budgie-showtime-applet (<< 1.9.0-1~),
Depends: budgie-extras-common, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Raven Widget displaying date and time on the Budgie Desktop
 This is part of a suite of Vala based Raven widgets for the Budgie
 Desktop that provide additional user orientated capabilities.
 The widgets can be used individually or as a set.
 .
 The ShowTime widget is a digital desktop clock, showing time and/or
 date.  Text color of both the displayed time and date can be set
 separately from the raven widget's menu

