Package: budgie-workspace-wallpaper-widget
Architecture: any
Replaces: budgie-workspace-wallpaper-applet,
Breaks: budgie-workspace-wallpaper-applet (<< 1.9.0-1~),
Depends: budgie-extras-common, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Raven Widget providing per workspace wallpaper
 This is part of a suite of Vala based Raven widgets for the Budgie
 Desktop that provide additional user orientated capabilities.
 The widgets can be used individually or as a set.
 .
 The workspace wallpaper widget shows a different wallpaper on each of
 the workspaces. Usage is simple: add the widget to Raven and set
 wallpapers on each of the workspaces in the way you are used to.
 Turn on and off by opening Raven.
 The widget will remember what wallpaper was set on each of the
 workspaces.
